+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
+<title>PayBrake: spots payment scams in marketplace chats</title>
+<meta name="description" content="PayBrake is a browser extension that spots payment-scam messages in marketplace chats and offers to switch to a PayPal Goods &amp; Services order instead. A PayPal AI Hackathon project.">
+<meta name="theme-color" content="#fbfbfa">
+<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
+<link rel="icon" href="img/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
+<link rel="icon" href="img/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png">
+<meta property="og:type" content="website">
+<meta property="og:title" content="PayBrake: spots payment scams in marketplace chats">
+<meta property="og:description" content="A browser extension that spots payment-scam messages in marketplace chats and offers a PayPal Goods &amp; Services order instead.">
+<meta property="og:image" content="img/og.jpg">
+<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
+<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
+<meta property="og:image:alt" content="PayBrake card under a seller message asking for a 500 kr deposit via PayPal Friends &amp; Family.">
+<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
+<style>
+:root{
+  --bg:#fbfbfa;
+  --ink:#1c1c1a;
+  --ink-2:#5f5e5a;
+  --line:#e6e5e1;
+  --tint:#f1f0ec;
+  --accent:#fd9a1c;
+  --font:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Noto Sans",Ubuntu,Cantarell,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
+}
+*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
+html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
+body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 1rem/1.6 var(--font);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale}
+.wrap{max-width:41rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.25rem}
+::selection{background:#fde3bd}
+
+a{color:inherit;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--accent);text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:.2em;transition:text-decoration-color .15s ease-out}
+@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){a:hover{text-decoration-color:var(--ink)}}
+:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}
+
+header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem}
+.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.625rem;min-height:44px;font-weight:600;font-size:1.0625rem;text-decoration:none}
+.brand img{display:block}
+header nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:var(--ink-2);text-decoration-color:transparent}
+@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){header nav a:hover{color:var(--ink);text-decoration-color:var(--accent)}}
+
+h1,h2{margin:0;font-weight:600;text-wrap:balance}
+h1{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.05rem + 2vw,2.125rem);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.018em;max-width:20em}
+h2{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:.75rem}
+p{margin:0 0 1rem;text-wrap:pretty}
+.muted{color:var(--ink-2)}
+code{font-family:inherit;font-size:.9375em;background:var(--tint);border-radius:4px;padding:.05em .3em;white-space:nowrap}
+
+.intro{padding-top:2.5rem}
+.shot{margin:2.5rem 0 0}
+.shot img{display:block;width:100%;max-width:439px;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff}
+.shot figcaption{margin-top:.625rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}
+
+section{margin-top:4.5rem}
+
+.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.75rem 1.5rem;margin:1.25rem 0 2rem}
+.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:.625rem 1.125rem;border-radius:6px;background:var(--accent);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .16s ease-out,background-color .15s ease-out}
+.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
+@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.btn:hover{background:#f08d0e}}
+.actions a:not(.btn){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}
+
+ol.steps{margin:0 0 1rem;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:s}
+ol.steps li{counter-increment:s;position:relative;padding-left:2.25rem;margin-bottom:.875rem}
+ol.steps li::before{content:counter(s);position:absolute;left:0;top:.05em;width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);background:#fff}
+.note{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}
+
+ul.nums{list-style:none;margin:0 0 1.25rem;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
+ul.nums li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5.25rem 1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.875rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
+ul.nums .v{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
+.tab{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
+
+details{margin-top:4.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
+summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:3.25rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}
+summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
+summary::after{content:"+";font-weight:400;font-size:1.375rem;line-height:1;color:var(--ink-2)}
+details[open] summary::after{content:"\2212"}
+details .body{padding:.25rem 0 1.25rem}
+details h3{font-size:1rem;margin:1rem 0 .25rem}
+details ul{margin:0 0 .5rem;padding-left:1.125rem}
+details li{margin-bottom:.25rem}
+
+footer{margin-top:3rem;padding:1.5rem 0 3rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}
+footer p{margin:0}
+
+@media (min-width:48rem){
+  body{font-size:1.0625rem}
+  header{padding-top:2rem}
+  .intro{padding-top:4rem}
+  section,details{margin-top:5.5rem}
+}
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
+  *{transition:none!important}
+}
+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<div class="wrap">
+<header>
+  <a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="PayBrake home"><img src="img/logo.svg" width="32" height="32" alt=""><span>PayBrake</span></a>
+  <nav aria-label="Project"><a href="https://github.com/lamapony/paybrake">GitHub</a></nav>
+</header>
+
+<main>
+  <div class="intro">
+    <h1>A browser extension that spots payment scams in marketplace chats and offers a PayPal order instead.</h1>
+    <figure class="shot">
+      <img src="img/chat-card.webp" width="439" height="642" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
+        alt="Demo marketplace chat. The seller writes: Send 500 kr deposit via PayPal Friends &amp; Family to hold it, I ship tomorrow. Below it PayBrake shows a High risk payment request card: Friends &amp; Family plus an upfront deposit means you may have no way to get your money back if the item never arrives. Signals: Friends &amp; Family, Upfront deposit, Pressure to hurry, Ships before you meet. Buttons: Switch to a PayPal order, and Pay anyway.">
+      <figcaption>The test build on our demo marketplace page. Names are fictional.</figcaption>
+    </figure>
+  </div>
+
+  <section aria-labelledby="try-h">
+    <h2 id="try-h">Try PayBrake in 2 minutes</h2>
+    <p>No install needed to look: the demo page shows a built-in preview of the card.</p>
+    <div class="actions">
+      <a class="btn" href="https://paybrake-demo.spbabinov.workers.dev/demo/marketplace.html">Open the demo</a>
+      <a href="https://github.com/lamapony/paybrake/releases/tag/v0.2.0-test.3">Download the test build</a>
+    </div>
+    <p>To run the real extension in Chrome:</p>
+    <ol class="steps">
+      <li>Download <code>paybrake-extension.zip</code> from the <a href="https://github.com/lamapony/paybrake/releases/tag/v0.2.0-test.3">v0.2.0-test.3 release</a> and unzip it.</li>
+      <li>Open <code>chrome://extensions</code>, turn on Developer mode, click Load unpacked and pick the unzipped <code>paybrake-extension</code> folder.</li>
+      <li>Open the <a href="https://paybrake-demo.spbabinov.workers.dev/demo/marketplace.html?live=1">live demo</a>. PayBrake shows a card under the risky message in the bike chat.</li>
+    </ol>
+    <p class="note">The test build works on our demo page only. The GitHub repo is private until judging, so the download needs repo access.</p>
+  </section>
+
+  <section aria-labelledby="acc-h">
+    <h2 id="acc-h">How accurate it is</h2>
+    <ul class="nums">
+      <li><span class="v">~85%</span><span>of scam messages got a card <span class="tab">(603 / 713)</span></span></li>
+      <li><span class="v">~1.6%</span><span>of normal messages got a card by mistake <span class="tab">(14 / 860)</span></span></li>
+    </ul>
+    <p class="muted">Measured on a held-out test split of 1,573 messages from public datasets, not on marketplace chats. The AI check uses Typesafe <code>jev-1.14.0</code> on masked text and answers in about 0.07&nbsp;s.</p>
+  </section>
+
+  <section aria-labelledby="priv-h">
+    <h2 id="priv-h">Privacy</h2>
+    <p>The rules run in your browser. With the AI check on (the default in this build), a masked copy of the chat goes to the configured server: emails, phone numbers, card numbers, IBANs, ID numbers and one-time codes are masked, but names, addresses and other free text are not. PayBrake never types or clicks in the chat.</p>
+  </section>
+
+  <details>
+    <summary>Details</summary>
+    <div class="body">
+      <h3>How it works</h3>
+      <ul>
+        <li>Rules in English and Danish check the open chat for risky payment requests. The AI check also reads every chat and can add a card the rules missed.</li>
+        <li>Switch to a PayPal order creates a PayPal sandbox order for the item. In the test build PayPal runs in mock mode.</li>
+        <li>Pay anyway hides the card and saves your choice on your device.</li>
+      </ul>
+      <h3>Limits</h3>
+      <ul>
+        <li>English and Danish only. No support for real marketplace sites yet.</li>
+        <li>The numbers above come from public datasets, so real marketplace accuracy is unknown.</li>
+      </ul>
+      <p style="margin:.75rem 0 0">More in the <a href="https://github.com/lamapony/paybrake#readme">README</a>. Found a bug? <a href="https://github.com/lamapony/paybrake/issues">Open an issue</a>.</p>
+    </div>
+  </details>
+</main>
+
+<footer>
+  <p>PayBrake is a PayPal AI Hackathon project. This is a test build: test orders only, no real money moves. Not affiliated with PayPal.</p>
+</footer>
+</div>
+</body>
+</html>
